WEBVTT

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:17.809
You are so smug and foolish
to take me lightly, bastard!

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:21.354
I am here for one reason only,
to take you down.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:24.858
Okay. So what's your next move
going to be, pretty boy?

00:00:24.941 --> 00:00:26.276
Orcs, attack!

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.778
That's a band of orcs!

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.447
What are we gonna do now?

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.448
Listen, Lars.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.407
Yeah? What is it?

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:34.743
-Is it me or him?
-What?

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:36.453
Who's the bigger babe magnet?

00:00:37.495 --> 00:00:38.830
You're both horrible!

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:41.249
At a time like this,
you're worried about--

00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:43.918
I asked you a question,
you damn flying rodent!

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.503
You… you, of course.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:49.257
Now, if you don't mind, would you stop
ripping my throat out, please?

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.967
You're so annoying!

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.263
He can't even tell the difference

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:57.265
between a true mcdreamy like me

00:00:57.348 --> 00:01:00.018
and some random schmuck
with a pretty face.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:05.065
Interripeli!

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.496
I must say, you have guts, pretty boy.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:46.374
You dared to attack
the most powerful wizard

00:02:46.457 --> 00:02:47.542
the world has ever known.

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:50.378
Not to mention
that you even tried to take him head-on.

00:02:50.461 --> 00:02:52.630
I am a warrior. I have no fear.

00:02:52.714 --> 00:02:55.133
Victory is meaningless
unless it's won fair and square.

00:02:55.717 --> 00:02:58.469
Why is some half-assed pretty boy
trying to be cool?

00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:00.013
You're absolutely ridiculous.

00:03:00.096 --> 00:03:01.514
You realize that?

00:03:01.598 --> 00:03:05.560
Being elegant, intellectual,
and, uh, supremely confident

00:03:05.643 --> 00:03:07.312
is for men like me.

00:03:07.395 --> 00:03:08.479
You can understand.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:11.566
It's certainly not
for little boys like you.

00:03:11.649 --> 00:03:14.319
Let's face it.
I'm the ultimate handsome hero.

00:03:14.903 --> 00:03:16.821
He's consistent. I'll give him that.

00:03:17.906 --> 00:03:20.325
I guess we're about to see
what kind of hero you really are.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.996
One question
before we get into this.

00:03:25.079 --> 00:03:27.582
Are you the one
who turned those humans into stone?

00:03:27.665 --> 00:03:29.959
You'll find out once we do battle!

00:03:32.295 --> 00:03:34.547
Let's go!

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:41.596
Yogeki Hyakuretsuzan!

00:03:42.263 --> 00:03:45.099
Whoo, doggie!
Talk about a close shave. Good try.

00:03:45.183 --> 00:03:47.060
You used Illusion.

00:03:47.143 --> 00:03:48.186
Be very careful!

00:03:48.269 --> 00:03:50.855
He's using
the Hariken style of swordsmanship!

00:03:50.939 --> 00:03:52.398
And what the hell is that?

00:03:52.482 --> 00:03:54.943
It's the source of all the classic styles.

00:03:55.026 --> 00:03:58.071
It's not like Gara's style.
It's a mix of swordsmanship and Ninjutsu!

00:03:58.154 --> 00:03:59.280
So don't get careless!

00:03:59.364 --> 00:04:01.950
Whoa. You sure know your trivia.

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:03.701
But then, you were a swordsman.

00:04:05.161 --> 00:04:07.038
I won't kill you immediately.

00:04:07.121 --> 00:04:09.958
I have some questions
that you'll need to answer first.

00:04:10.041 --> 00:04:13.628
No. I don't feel like answering questions.

00:04:13.711 --> 00:04:14.837
Now, take this!

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.262
You were so damn serious.

00:04:22.345 --> 00:04:23.972
You know how boring that is?

00:04:24.055 --> 00:04:26.099
Dumb as a bag of rocks.

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:27.809
Sean Ari.

00:04:28.518 --> 00:04:30.436
Sean Ari. What have you done with her?

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.981
You used Illusion.

00:04:34.524 --> 00:04:36.526
She was a magnificent fighter.

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:38.444
Tell me, why did she disappear?

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:41.864
-Were we betrayed by her?
-Who knows?

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:44.909
She probably got tired of pretending
to fight in this fake war.

00:04:44.993 --> 00:04:46.202
Shut up!

00:04:46.286 --> 00:04:48.913
That's something
you'd never be able to understand.

00:04:48.997 --> 00:04:52.375
We Three Sorcerer Generals
share a bond stronger than blood.

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:53.793
She'd never betray us!

00:04:53.876 --> 00:04:55.837
It's the one thing I can be certain of.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.047
Hmm. Well, well.

00:04:58.131 --> 00:05:00.675
I wonder if that means
she fell in love with me for real?

00:05:00.758 --> 00:05:02.719
What? Where's Sean?

00:05:02.802 --> 00:05:04.804
What did you do to her, you bastard?

00:05:04.887 --> 00:05:06.848
Tell me while you still can.

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:11.394
Don't tell me
you were in love with that virgin?

00:05:11.936 --> 00:05:13.521
You gotta be kidding me.

00:05:13.604 --> 00:05:16.399
You animal. What did you do to her?

00:05:18.401 --> 00:05:19.694
You really need to ask?

00:05:19.777 --> 00:05:21.738
She tasted so good.

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:24.449
I took her. That's what I did.

00:05:24.532 --> 00:05:27.076
Oh yeah, and she actually was a virgin.

00:05:30.455 --> 00:05:32.498
You disgusting creep!

00:05:35.293 --> 00:05:36.461
That sword! No way!

00:05:36.544 --> 00:05:38.296
Okay, Efreet!

00:05:38.379 --> 00:05:40.590
I carried you with me all this way.

00:05:40.673 --> 00:05:43.593
Now it's time for you to do
what you were meant to do.

00:05:43.676 --> 00:05:45.136
So get at it!

00:05:50.141 --> 00:05:53.686
So it truly is
the legendary Sword of Fire.

00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:55.438
You're not a pretty boy.

00:05:56.939 --> 00:05:58.608
You're a pretty girl!

00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:00.735
What does that matter?

00:06:00.818 --> 00:06:02.820
My mission hasn't changed at all.

00:06:02.904 --> 00:06:07.283
I've never lost to anyone in my
entire life except for the Empress Nei.

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:11.496
You men are pathetic!
You only have one thing on your minds.

00:06:11.996 --> 00:06:13.790
Yeah. Well, you got me there.

00:06:14.665 --> 00:06:15.500
Huh?

00:06:16.084 --> 00:06:18.169
Empress Nei gave me this power

00:06:18.252 --> 00:06:21.339
in exchange
for my pledging absolute loyalty to her!

00:06:24.384 --> 00:06:25.718
I'd be careful, boss!

00:06:25.802 --> 00:06:27.512
This one's got some serious magic.

00:06:27.595 --> 00:06:33.476
Kandalos-trata amsotos yonde lutsun!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.561
Talas!

00:06:40.483 --> 00:06:41.943
My body…

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:44.821
Dark Schneider!

00:06:46.531 --> 00:06:49.325
Your clothes,
your body, blood, and flesh

00:06:49.409 --> 00:06:51.285
will all turn to stone.

00:06:51.369 --> 00:06:54.455
You'll stand there exposed
to the wind and rain forever!

00:06:54.539 --> 00:06:56.290
Your legend has reached its end.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.294
If I really am turning to stone,

00:07:00.378 --> 00:07:03.464
I'll make
a freaking dynamite statue for sure.

00:07:06.884 --> 00:07:09.011
Men like you are nothing special.

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:12.974
When you're a warrior like me,
man or woman doesn't matter.

00:07:13.474 --> 00:07:15.518
What matters is life and death.

00:07:15.601 --> 00:07:19.313
You'll regret opposing Empress Nei
and making an enemy of me.

00:07:19.397 --> 00:07:20.982
Listen to me, girl.

00:07:21.566 --> 00:07:24.735
You say you've never
met a man who could best you in battle.

00:07:24.819 --> 00:07:27.613
And you say
that you're not a woman, but a warrior.

00:07:27.697 --> 00:07:31.492
But that just proves
how hung up you are about being a woman.

00:07:32.076 --> 00:07:33.494
What a pitiful girl.

00:07:33.578 --> 00:07:35.746
Looks like you need me to set you free.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.790
Shut up, you stupid fool!

00:07:37.874 --> 00:07:40.585
All of your talking only serves
to make you more pathetic.

00:07:40.668 --> 00:07:42.795
Do you really think
you could seal me away

00:07:42.879 --> 00:07:45.006
with a measly little petrification spell?

00:07:45.089 --> 00:07:48.134
Oh, and, uh, there is a spell
to turn me back again, right?

00:07:51.554 --> 00:07:52.472
Good luck!

00:07:52.555 --> 00:07:55.725
That spell I used on you
is not just any incantation!

00:07:55.808 --> 00:07:58.603
It's an old spell
resurrected by Empress Nei!

00:07:59.187 --> 00:08:02.315
This spell's power is derived
from the ancient war gods!

00:08:02.398 --> 00:08:03.858
What the hell?

00:08:03.941 --> 00:08:07.528
Then that means it's High Ancient Magic?

00:08:08.613 --> 00:08:10.531
That's right, Dark Schneider!

00:08:10.615 --> 00:08:13.868
I wish I hadn't said that,
'cause that can only mean one thing.

00:08:13.951 --> 00:08:16.287
I can't use normal magic
to break this spell!

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.872
Aww. Too bad.

00:08:17.955 --> 00:08:20.750
And look.
The stone has already reached your chest.

00:08:21.959 --> 00:08:23.753
Can't you do anything about this?

00:08:23.836 --> 00:08:25.671
I thought you knew
Ancient High Magic too!

00:08:25.755 --> 00:08:26.964
Least that's what you said!

00:08:27.048 --> 00:08:29.050
Now we're dealing with ancient gods.

00:08:29.133 --> 00:08:31.427
You know how hard it is
to come up with a counter spell

00:08:31.511 --> 00:08:33.179
when you're half turned to stone?

00:08:33.262 --> 00:08:35.264
I need to think! I need to focus!

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:36.432
Then you've got this.

00:08:36.516 --> 00:08:39.852
All you have to do is find out
which god is the source of that spell.

00:08:39.936 --> 00:08:43.022
Ugh. I don't have a chance in hell
of finding out which god.

00:08:43.105 --> 00:08:43.981
Wait a minute.

00:08:44.065 --> 00:08:46.442
Even if I'm not
in communication with that god,

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:49.612
it's still possible that I could find
another one somewhere close by

00:08:49.695 --> 00:08:52.156
and ask him to deactivate the spell.

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.992
Except I don't have any damn time
to look for one.

00:08:55.076 --> 00:08:56.327
This isn't good!

00:08:57.745 --> 00:08:59.997
I don't want to be stuck
in this stupid pose!

00:09:00.081 --> 00:09:02.708
What have I ever done to deserve this?

00:09:04.669 --> 00:09:06.963
You know, after turning you to stone,

00:09:07.046 --> 00:09:09.840
I was going
to leave you be for all eternity…

00:09:11.676 --> 00:09:14.303
but what you did was unforgivable.

00:09:14.387 --> 00:09:18.307
You defiled Sean Ari and destroyed
the bond we had with no remorse.

00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:20.351
So for that, I've changed my mind,

00:09:20.434 --> 00:09:22.395
and I'm going to kill you on the spot.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:25.982
You see, if your statue stays pristine,

00:09:26.065 --> 00:09:30.695
the spell can be broken
by a wizard or magician with enough power.

00:09:30.778 --> 00:09:34.824
However, if even the smallest piece
of your body breaks off

00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:36.409
while you're made of stone,

00:09:36.492 --> 00:09:38.828
It'll be impossible
to bring you back to life.

00:09:38.911 --> 00:09:40.580
Could we talk about this?

00:09:40.663 --> 00:09:41.789
Shatter,

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.916
Dark Schneider!

00:09:44.917 --> 00:09:45.876
Dio!

00:09:49.839 --> 00:09:50.965
This can't be happening.

00:09:54.802 --> 00:09:57.179
What? How can this be?

00:09:57.847 --> 00:09:59.348
A Ritual Spider?

00:09:59.849 --> 00:10:00.891
Dammit!

00:10:01.601 --> 00:10:03.227
Talisman Magic.

00:10:03.811 --> 00:10:05.688
Sean Ari, why?

00:10:05.771 --> 00:10:08.316
Why did you betray Empress Nei?

00:10:08.399 --> 00:10:10.860
Why did you betray the Sorcerer Generals?

00:10:10.943 --> 00:10:14.780
Kai, you may not understand,
but this man has great power.

00:10:14.864 --> 00:10:19.493
Not even Master Kall-Su, nor Empress Nei,
have the abilities that he can command.

00:10:20.077 --> 00:10:23.956
His powers are so strong
that they completely envelop his enemies.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.333
Open your eyes!

00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:27.793
This is the first time
you've been with a man.

00:10:27.877 --> 00:10:30.630
You're hoping and dreaming
that he's special, but he's not!

00:10:30.713 --> 00:10:33.549
You might be right, Kai, but there's more.

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:36.594
When I fought him, I sensed his abilities.

00:10:36.677 --> 00:10:39.221
I felt how truly powerful he is!

00:10:40.222 --> 00:10:41.682
You have to believe me, Kai!

00:10:41.766 --> 00:10:43.517
He's far beyond Master Kall-Su.

00:10:43.601 --> 00:10:45.436
Stronger than even Empress Nei.

00:10:45.519 --> 00:10:48.356
I am sure
that's how he won over Master Gara too!

00:10:48.439 --> 00:10:49.273
Sean…

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:53.486
What can I say?

00:10:53.569 --> 00:10:55.863
They always come back
wanting more, huh?

00:10:56.364 --> 00:10:58.991
You're so stupid!
I told you to be careful!

00:10:59.075 --> 00:11:01.118
You know,
you're actually pretty cute when you care.

00:11:01.202 --> 00:11:03.079
Can you, uh,
get your friend to calm down?

00:11:03.162 --> 00:11:04.205
I pity you.

00:11:04.955 --> 00:11:06.666
You're so damned loyal.

00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:09.919
He's just using you. Can't you see that?

00:11:10.002 --> 00:11:11.837
Get out of the way
and let me get rid of him.

00:11:11.921 --> 00:11:14.298
No, Kai! I can't do that!

00:11:14.382 --> 00:11:15.633
I have to protect him

00:11:15.716 --> 00:11:18.719
even if that means opposing Empress Nei
and betraying you.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:20.346
Sean Ari!

00:11:21.806 --> 00:11:25.142
Talisman! Ritual Spider, devour her now!

00:11:29.647 --> 00:11:31.148
Yogeki Hyakuretsuzan!

00:11:38.906 --> 00:11:41.909
<i>It's no use.</i>
<i>She's much stronger than I am.</i>

00:11:42.868 --> 00:11:45.830
I can't believe you let yourself
fall in love with him, Sean

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:49.542
It's done!
I can never forgive you for this!

00:11:50.418 --> 00:11:51.627
I have no choice.

00:11:51.711 --> 00:11:53.963
In the name of the god of war, Yng Wei,

00:11:54.046 --> 00:11:55.965
I'm going to kill you both!

00:11:56.048 --> 00:11:57.216
She means it this time!

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:00.511
No, Kai! I don't care if you kill me!

00:12:00.594 --> 00:12:02.179
But I'm begging you to let him live!

00:12:02.263 --> 00:12:03.097
No!

00:12:03.848 --> 00:12:05.141
You'll both die!

00:12:10.771 --> 00:12:13.315
You son of a bitch! What's so funny?

00:12:14.108 --> 00:12:16.444
You're gonna kill me, huh?

00:12:17.737 --> 00:12:19.363
You idiot!

00:12:20.823 --> 00:12:23.367
In your anger, you slipped up
and said the name of the god

00:12:23.451 --> 00:12:25.202
who's the source of this spell.

00:12:25.786 --> 00:12:28.414
Your puny powers mean nothing at all!

00:12:28.497 --> 00:12:33.002
You're no match for me!

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:37.423
What? That's impossible!

00:12:37.506 --> 00:12:39.133
Incredible!

00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:45.306
Behold the one and only
powerful Dark Schneider!

00:12:45.389 --> 00:12:47.808
Just when I thought
I couldn't get any more embarrassed.

00:12:47.892 --> 00:12:48.726
Oh brother!

00:12:48.809 --> 00:12:50.394
I'm unique in the world.

00:12:50.478 --> 00:12:53.230
And I'm the most beautiful human
on the face of the earth!

00:12:53.314 --> 00:12:56.525
Oh, gods! How could you have played
such a cruel trick on me

00:12:56.609 --> 00:12:59.320
and saddle me
with such a heavy burden as this?

00:13:00.863 --> 00:13:03.115
<i>Ew. That's disgusting!</i>

00:13:03.199 --> 00:13:04.992
You filthy pig!

00:13:05.075 --> 00:13:08.370
That's the last time
you'll swing that thing around like that

00:13:08.454 --> 00:13:10.706
Because now you die! Talas!

00:13:13.292 --> 00:13:15.795
Thanks for the tickle.

00:13:16.378 --> 00:13:17.880
Your god, Yng Wei,

00:13:17.963 --> 00:13:20.591
the one who's the source
of your petrification spell,

00:13:20.674 --> 00:13:24.220
he's just a subordinate
to one of the gods I'm connected with.

00:13:24.303 --> 00:13:25.846
In other words,

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:29.517
my god can deactivate
all your High Ancient Magic!

00:13:30.017 --> 00:13:32.478
And now it is my turn!

00:13:32.561 --> 00:13:35.022
Witness the power of my god, Blackmore!

00:13:35.105 --> 00:13:38.275
From the snow-capped mountains
to the gates of Babylon.

00:13:38.359 --> 00:13:39.693
Ray Bow!

00:13:47.743 --> 00:13:49.829
And I went easy on you.

00:13:50.704 --> 00:13:52.915
Only because you're a woman.

00:13:54.166 --> 00:13:57.795
And now this thing of mine
is gonna teach you a lesson.

00:13:58.462 --> 00:14:01.090
It's so huge
it's shaking hands with my belly button,

00:14:01.173 --> 00:14:02.466
but I guess you noticed that.

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:07.680
Please! Don't do anything to her!

00:14:07.763 --> 00:14:09.890
She was just being loyal to Empress Nei!

00:14:11.433 --> 00:14:14.562
If I were you,
I wouldn't get so cocky just yet!

00:14:14.645 --> 00:14:15.938
I'm not done with you.

00:14:18.315 --> 00:14:20.651
Come to me at once, my servant!

00:14:28.701 --> 00:14:30.286
It's a cockatrice!

00:14:30.369 --> 00:14:31.328
How appropriate.

00:14:31.954 --> 00:14:34.582
There's no way she could have ever cast
that petrification spell

00:14:34.665 --> 00:14:36.792
on the entire city by herself.

00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:38.252
It takes too much magic.

00:14:38.335 --> 00:14:41.589
This cockatrice is the one
who's behind that herd of statues.

00:14:41.672 --> 00:14:43.465
Hey, warrior!

00:14:43.549 --> 00:14:46.010
Siccing a monster
on your enemy when you're about to lose,

00:14:46.093 --> 00:14:47.428
reeks of desperation.

00:14:47.511 --> 00:14:49.930
Shut up! You're just a pile of lust!

00:14:50.014 --> 00:14:54.268
You deceive women and use them as shields,
you filthy, dirty, disgusting coward!

00:14:54.351 --> 00:14:55.978
Go, my Cockatrice!

00:14:56.061 --> 00:14:59.189
Turn him to stone!
Shatter him to pieces!

00:15:00.274 --> 00:15:01.191
She's not lying.

00:15:01.692 --> 00:15:04.111
If you get too close,
it will turn you to stone!

00:15:07.656 --> 00:15:09.074
Petrifying gas?

00:15:10.034 --> 00:15:11.285
Damn!

00:15:11.368 --> 00:15:14.496
That gas's petrifying effect
doesn't come from any ancient god!

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:17.666
I thought I'd already found a way
to deactivate her spell.

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.293
Now I'm back to square one!

00:15:19.835 --> 00:15:22.504
Don't even think you're going
to escape from me this time.

00:15:22.588 --> 00:15:26.342
You're going to die together
with that miserable traitor!

00:15:26.425 --> 00:15:28.093
It's managed to get upwind from us!

00:15:29.094 --> 00:15:29.929
Get them!

00:15:32.222 --> 00:15:33.682
No! This way!

00:15:35.309 --> 00:15:36.435
Dark Schneider!

00:15:41.565 --> 00:15:42.858
You're hurt!

00:15:44.652 --> 00:15:46.570
I'm going to finish you off now.

00:15:48.614 --> 00:15:49.990
Hot damn!

00:15:50.074 --> 00:15:53.118
She could control that beast
as though it were one with her own body!

00:15:53.702 --> 00:15:58.040
That crystal amplifies her thoughts
and transmits them to the cockatrice.

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:01.627
There's got to be a way
that we can destroy that thing,

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:04.421
or, at the very least,
get it away from her somehow.

00:16:04.505 --> 00:16:07.299
That's it!
Then we could take-- Uh, too late.

00:16:09.843 --> 00:16:12.471
A little too close
for comfort if you ask me.

00:16:22.356 --> 00:16:24.233
Farewell to you, Dark Schneider!

00:16:32.074 --> 00:16:33.200
It can't be.

00:16:33.784 --> 00:16:35.536
The wind, it's changing!

00:16:37.204 --> 00:16:38.872
<i>Oh no! My crystal!</i>

00:16:45.629 --> 00:16:47.047
Cockatrice!

00:16:49.091 --> 00:16:52.219
It's gone completely out of its mind.
You can't control it now.

00:16:56.348 --> 00:16:57.683
Kai!

00:17:02.271 --> 00:17:04.690
She was so busy gloating
over her coming victory,

00:17:04.773 --> 00:17:07.317
she didn't notice
the wind had changed direction.

00:17:07.401 --> 00:17:08.652
Pathetic little woman.

00:17:10.154 --> 00:17:12.781
A mad cockatrice is a piece of cake.

00:17:14.158 --> 00:17:15.784
But I can tell you one thing.

00:17:15.868 --> 00:17:18.537
You're gonna owe me big time after this.

00:17:19.413 --> 00:17:21.790
Cockatrice be Damned!

00:17:23.584 --> 00:17:24.877
That's showing them!

00:17:32.509 --> 00:17:33.510
Kill me.

00:17:33.594 --> 00:17:37.014
If you don't kill me today,
you'll live to regret it!

00:17:37.723 --> 00:17:40.517
You broke my spell and killed my beast.

00:17:41.018 --> 00:17:44.980
However, I haven't lost to you yet
in a fair battle!

00:17:45.564 --> 00:17:48.692
After I've healed,
I'll come after you again.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:17:59.661
Come and kill me anytime.

00:18:00.287 --> 00:18:01.872
But let's fix you up.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:09.129
If you're gonna kill me,
we'll have to heal those wounds properly.

00:18:13.592 --> 00:18:16.053
<i> He's… he's so warm.</i>

00:18:16.637 --> 00:18:19.765
<i>I never knew a man's body</i>
<i>could be so big and warm.</i>

00:18:20.516 --> 00:18:23.185
<i>Why is my heart beating so fast?</i>

00:18:27.523 --> 00:18:30.609
Listen.
I have to suck the poison out of you.

00:18:30.692 --> 00:18:31.777
Huh?

00:18:50.254 --> 00:18:52.256
Huh.

00:19:08.105 --> 00:19:11.108
I have to say,
you're a tough opponent, you know that?

00:19:11.859 --> 00:19:13.652
That was a close one, actually.

00:19:13.735 --> 00:19:15.529
Much closer than I'd like to admit.

00:19:19.032 --> 00:19:21.034
I'm going to warn you this one time.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:24.830
The third Sorcerer General
is more experienced than me or Sean.

00:19:24.913 --> 00:19:25.747
Remember that.

00:19:25.831 --> 00:19:28.000
Don't think you'll have
an easy road ahead.

00:19:28.083 --> 00:19:29.334
It's just the opposite.

00:19:29.418 --> 00:19:30.711
Is that right?

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:34.506
<i>His power has increased</i>
<i>through the ages.</i>

00:19:35.716 --> 00:19:37.885
<i>No one knows what he's doing now.</i>

00:19:38.552 --> 00:19:44.725
<i>I did hear that a few years ago he used</i>
<i>his own magic to make his body immortal.</i>

00:19:46.727 --> 00:19:49.771
His magic is getting stronger
and stronger every day.

00:19:49.855 --> 00:19:52.816
They say there are only a few spells
that'll work on him.

00:19:53.609 --> 00:19:55.569
You're not worried about me, are you?

00:19:55.652 --> 00:19:57.738
That's absurd, you idiot!

00:19:57.821 --> 00:19:58.989
I don't want you to die

00:19:59.072 --> 00:20:01.366
before I get the chance
to kill you myself!

00:20:04.703 --> 00:20:06.205
-Hey, virgin!
-Huh?

00:20:06.288 --> 00:20:08.081
You guys were pretty good friends, right?

00:20:08.165 --> 00:20:09.333
So take care of her.

00:20:11.501 --> 00:20:13.086
Ow! What are you doing?

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:15.297
What'd I say? You're ruining my face!

00:20:16.882 --> 00:20:18.300
Bye, bye, ladies!

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:22.137
Make sure you grow up into good women,
otherwise, I'll be back.

00:20:22.221 --> 00:20:25.224
-Where have I heard that before?
-It's what Yoko'd say…

00:20:25.307 --> 00:20:27.434
-Yep. Well…
-I didn't sound like her?

00:20:27.517 --> 00:20:29.144
I will dropkick you again.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:31.271
Sean,

00:20:32.147 --> 00:20:34.399
I think I understand what you meant now.

00:20:36.193 --> 00:20:38.237
Please forgive me if you can.

00:20:38.904 --> 00:20:39.821
Kai, I…

00:20:40.322 --> 00:20:43.075
I know he's a legendary wizard,

00:20:43.158 --> 00:20:44.785
but he's still a human being.

00:20:45.285 --> 00:20:48.205
I don't think a human,
no matter how skilled,

00:20:48.288 --> 00:20:50.958
has the slightest chance
against the Count.

00:20:52.125 --> 00:20:55.045
Take care of yourself, Dark Schneider.

00:21:03.303 --> 00:21:05.013
What is it? What's wrong?

00:21:08.976 --> 00:21:11.019
Hey! What the heck is going on?

00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:12.854
I wanna do laundry.

00:21:12.938 --> 00:21:13.897
Hmm?

00:21:13.981 --> 00:21:16.483
I said I wanna do the laundry!

00:21:18.277 --> 00:21:20.404
I'm not liking this!

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:22.614
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:21:22.698 --> 00:21:26.952
<i>I must have used too much magic</i>
<i>since I left the ninja fortress.</i>

00:21:27.953 --> 00:21:30.289
<i>Lucien Renlen</i>
<i>is getting control of me again.</i>

00:21:30.789 --> 00:21:32.582
<i>Dammit! I have to block it!</i>

00:21:33.542 --> 00:21:35.794
<i>But we're in</i>
<i>the middle of enemy territory!</i>

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:39.756
Dark Schneider!

00:21:43.719 --> 00:21:44.678
Hello there.

00:21:45.595 --> 00:21:49.349
Huh? Dark Schneider!

00:21:49.433 --> 00:21:52.936
Um, do you know if Yoko is around here?

00:21:53.645 --> 00:21:54.855
Yoko!

00:21:56.982 --> 00:22:00.360
Onward!
There's no turning back now!

00:22:00.444 --> 00:22:03.196
Show them
what a knight's honor really means!

00:22:07.284 --> 00:22:09.661
Tell me how the battle is proceeding.

00:22:09.745 --> 00:22:11.204
Please, dear Father.

00:22:11.288 --> 00:22:13.957
Don't speak.
Your wounds could reopen at any time.

00:22:14.041 --> 00:22:15.876
Put your mind at rest, Sire.

00:22:15.959 --> 00:22:17.502
Our army is ready.

00:22:17.586 --> 00:22:19.254
They won't lose. They're strong.

00:22:19.338 --> 00:22:20.422
Please, Sire.

00:22:20.505 --> 00:22:23.300
Focus on recovering
from your wounds as soon as you can.

00:22:23.884 --> 00:22:25.469
I suppose I should.

00:22:26.094 --> 00:22:27.596
By the way, Great Priest,

00:22:28.180 --> 00:22:31.308
has Tia Noto Yoko left the castle already?

00:22:32.225 --> 00:22:37.064
Yes. She left some time ago
on her search for Dark Schneider.

00:22:37.147 --> 00:22:40.525
It's a daunting task,
but that is the destiny

00:22:40.609 --> 00:22:44.279
that awaits the one who breaks the seal
of the legendary wizard.

00:22:44.363 --> 00:22:48.450
She's strong in the same way
that her late mother was.

00:22:48.533 --> 00:22:50.619
I have no doubt she'll succeed.

00:22:51.119 --> 00:22:53.455
Princess Sheila, Great Priest.

00:22:53.955 --> 00:22:56.041
The fourth arch has just fallen!

00:22:56.124 --> 00:22:57.417
It can't be.

00:22:57.501 --> 00:23:00.837
That means
that the front arch is our last defense!

00:23:00.921 --> 00:23:04.216
I'm afraid it's only
a matter of time before it falls.

00:23:04.299 --> 00:23:05.675
This is quite dire.

00:23:06.593 --> 00:23:09.846
If they get control of
the seal guarded by our royal family,

00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:11.890
the world will be destroyed!

00:23:11.973 --> 00:23:15.352
<i>We have to stop that</i>
<i>from happening, at any cost.</i>

00:23:16.645 --> 00:23:18.063
I fear we're losing this.

00:23:24.361 --> 00:23:28.657
You seem to be in a bit
of a pickle without Dark Schneider!

00:23:28.740 --> 00:23:30.617
What? Is this a joke?

00:23:31.201 --> 00:23:32.661
Ninja Master Gara?

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:41.545
Ninja Master Gara
and his 2,000 Dark Ninjas!

00:23:41.628 --> 00:23:43.004
Huh?

00:23:45.882 --> 00:23:49.136
I'm here to help, old man!
